Performer's claims (verify each): order auth (401, nothing charged, no metric line) → budget charge on every 
authenticated request (429 on limit or limiter failure) → 415 non-JSON → 413 raw body > 16384 bytes counted on bytes 
received (declared Content-Length refused early; chunked/understated cut while streaming) → 400 invalid 
