metric line. Event drop policy: whole event dropped if not an object, unknown type, missing required field, or any 
known field invalid/not allowed for its type; unknown fields ignored, never copied; client appVersion ignored. Log 
line: one console.info JSON line per accepted event with keys schema, ts (server), appVersion (server: package.json 
version + first 12 hex of VERCEL_GIT_COMMIT_SHA or +local), type, [reason], [conversationType], [durationMs], [count], 
[occurredAt ISO]; all values rebuilt from validated input. Enums and bounds as in metrics-contract.ts (stream name 
folded into event type because BR-013 allows no separate stream field). Tests 9/9; messaging DB suite 162/163 (known 
flake, rerun ok); E2E 51/51; build ok; type-check and eslint clean.
