only; unknown fields, free text, out-of-range numbers, forged version absent; > 50 events or > 16 KB rejected; rate 
limit and limiter failure reject; unauthenticated rejected with no metric line; route review gate recorded.
Covers: FR-027, BR-013, AC-028, AC-035
