Reasoning: Every pending/stored match in the outbox and across tabs depends on key-based correlation; it is observable 
on its own (AC-050).
Task: The sender's representations of a message (create/fence responses — already carrying it since T2 —, feed fetches 
via the repository mapper, Realtime events — whose INSERT payload already has `client_message_id` —, optimistic items) 
carry `clientMessageId`; the feed matches pending items to stored messages only by that key in every sender tab.
