test-controlled clock for expiry, 409 key reuse, 403/400/413) pass 3 consecutive runs in Chrome and Edge, with an 
outbox inspection for the preserved send time; regression suites pass.
Covers: FR-002, FR-007, FR-008, FR-009, BR-005, BR-006, AC-007, AC-008, AC-009, AC-010, AC-043, AC-046
Root: T9
Depends on: T3, T10

